Chapter: ProofQedVacuous

 Regression guard: the full claim/proof/qed sugar must thread the
 claim's type to the proof body. Claiming Integer === Text and offering
 Refl must be rejected (CDX2001), exactly as the plain annotated-def
 form (refl-mismatch) is. This previously slipped through because the
 claim arm's then-branch was lost to dangling-else, so the claim type
 never reached the proof.

Section: Bad Proof

  claim refl-bad : Integer === Text
  proof refl-bad = Refl
  qed

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "unreachable"
  end
